# Cross-cutting only. Each app keeps its own .gitignore for its own build artefacts and
# local state — scrapbook/.gitignore is where pb_data/, the PocketBase binary and the
# bot's secrets are excluded, and those patterns resolve relative to that file.

.DS_Store
.claude/settings.local.json
node_modules/

# Key material. Kept across the push-notification rollback deliberately: a VAPID private
# key reached a commit once, from a file sitting in the repo root during setup, and the
# pair had to be rotated and purged from history. The rule outlives the feature.
*.pem
*.key
.*.swp

# A stray PocketBase data directory. `--dir=./pb_data` is relative, so starting the server
# from the repo root instead of scrapbook/ creates a second, empty database here and serves
# THAT — which looks exactly like "my data is gone". scrapbook/.gitignore only covers
# scrapbook/pb_data, so this one was untracked and committable.
pb_data/
